Additional notes specific to this project:

1. Persona content: The AI personas included in this project are
   fictional simulations inspired by publicly known figures, built from
   publicly available writings, interviews, and biographical summaries.
   They do not represent the real individuals' actual views, statements,
   or endorsements, and are provided for commentary, education, and
   parody purposes only. See DISCLAIMER section in README.md.

2. Third-party AI providers: This project does not include or
   redistribute any AI model or API. Users must supply their own API
   key(s) from the AI provider(s) of their choice (e.g. Anthropic,
   OpenAI, Google), and are separately bound by those providers' own
   terms of service, usage policies, and pricing.
